#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:7
#: 68cb9420f5364a4f9babba5b25d44b5c
msgid "Camera Shutter Triggering using CHDK"
msgstr "使用 CHDK 触发相机快门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:9
#: 1d8c87b8d5d44f9e9008313b86c8af39
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up camera shutter triggering for Canon "
"Cameras that support the `Canon Hacker Development Kit "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ (CHDK)."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何为支持 `Canon Hacker Development Kit "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__（CHDK）的佳能相机设置相机快门触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:13
#: e17ec54408414a9dbb0a0f781d03fc82
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:15
#: 2982c864639a489095d694fa27a7c7d5
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows you to :ref:`configure a servo or relay output as the "
"control signal for the camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` so"
" that it can be used in :ref:`Camera Missions <common-camera-control-and-"
"auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. Additional hardware is required to "
"convert the shutter activation signal to the format expected by the "
"particular camera."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 允许您 :ref:`将舵机或继电器输出配置为相机快门的控制信号 <common-camera-shutter-with-"
"servo>`，以便在 :ref:`拍照任务 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-"
"planner>` 中使用。需要额外硬件将快门触发信号转换为特定相机所需的格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:22
#: ff9e41e3b7b54ffb8b7282162afdc885
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up the shutter-trigger for Canon Cameras "
"that support the *Canon Hacker Development Kit* (CHDK). The method connects "
"the ArduPilot output to the camera using a \\*custom cable\\*, and causes a "
"script running on the camera to take pictures when the *relay* output "
"voltage goes high."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何为支持 *Canon Hacker Development Kit*（CHDK）的佳能相机设置快门触发。该方法通过 \\*定制线缆\\* 将"
" ArduPilot 输出连接到相机，当 *继电器* 输出电压变高时，运行在相机上的脚本触发拍照。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:28
#: 428d96f029d24f148dac6ff7f34a2254
msgid ""
"At the end of the article is a :ref:`list of cables that you can purchase "
"<common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>` instead "
"of using the custom cable (please extend this list if you find another "
"appropriate cable)."
msgstr ""
"本文末尾提供了 :ref:`可购买的现成线缆列表 <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>`，代替自制线缆（如果您发现其他合适的线缆，请扩充此列表）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:32
#: 37cf00c870aa4356a531245f0de56c8b
msgid "The article covers both Pixhawk and APM2.x."
msgstr "本文同时适用于 Pixhawk 和 APM2.x。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:39
#: 64e39907ee054a5580aa78aa1e4921df
msgid "APM Connected to a Canon SX260 HS using a custom cable"
msgstr "APM 通过定制线缆连接到 Canon SX260 HS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:43
#: 22bf526dc48e4fec9ce2959abfef7aec
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use a :ref:`servo output instead of a relay <common-"
"apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial_using_a_servo_instead_of_a_relay>`."
msgstr ""
"也可以 :ref:`使用舵机输出代替继电器 <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_using_a_servo_instead_of_a_relay>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:47
#: 6fdd233891ed4f54af4030345c68249d
msgid "CHKD and ArduPilot integration"
msgstr "CHKD 与 ArduPilot 集成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:49
#: 273292bca22a425f98efbc35e0aeb932
msgid ""
"CHDK is an experimental (and free) development tool, which temporarily "
"patches (supported) *Canon cameras* so that they can be controlled using "
"scripts. The scripts are able to take pictures, control the camera zoom, set"
" the focus, and access many other camera features."
msgstr ""
"CHDK "
"是一个实验性（且免费）的开发工具，可临时对（受支持的）*佳能相机*进行修补，使其可以通过脚本控制。这些脚本能够拍照、控制相机变焦、设置对焦以及访问许多其他相机功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:54
#: 5d7477b460b247b7a3dd5ee499ee3464
msgid ""
"Scripts can also read the camera USB port voltage and execute different "
"instructions/functions based on the signal pulse-length. When using a relay,"
" the script can be very simple — all it needs to do is check the voltage (in"
" a loop), and take a picture when it detects the relay voltage go high. More"
" complicated scripts might first set the focus, zoom, or preform any other "
"default behaviour."
msgstr ""
"脚本还可以读取相机 USB "
"端口电压，并根据信号脉冲宽度执行不同的指令/函数。使用继电器时，脚本可以非常简单——只需在循环中检测电压，当检测到继电器电压升高时拍照即可。更复杂的脚本可能先设置对焦、变焦或执行其他默认操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:61
#: 7abcb7ae4b8f4561a395da32b751d963
msgid ""
"The `CHDK Wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ documentation explains "
"which cameras are supported, how you install CHDK on you camera, and how to "
"install and run scripts."
msgstr ""
"`CHDK Wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ 文档介绍了哪些相机受支持、如何在您的相机上安装 "
"CHDK，以及如何安装和运行脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:66
#: 69417de3d8ef4dc18e843b0218c6069d
msgid "Cable for connecting to Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到 Pixhawk 的线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:70
#: 8c03031608e740639fc82e6a2ee6f3a2
msgid ""
"See :ref:`CHDK cables for purchase <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>` if you just want to buy a cable. This "
"section is useful if you want to create your own cable or understand what "
"the cable needs to do."
msgstr ""
"如果只想购买现成线缆，请参见 :ref:`可购买的 CHDK 线缆 <common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-"
"tutorial_chdk_cables_for_purchase>`。如果想自制线缆或了解线缆的功能，本节内容有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:74
#: 3543c8e05eb64c06a66eb617f081d2aa
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk you have to modify the APM cable in the following section, "
"adding a circuit step the output pin signal voltage from 3.3 to 5 volts. "
"This is required because the relay/servo output voltage is approximately "
"3.3V while CHDK needs 5V to trigger."
msgstr ""
"对于 Pixhawk，您必须修改以下部分的 APM 线缆，添加一个将输出引脚信号电压从 3.3V 升到 5V "
"的电路。这是必要的，因为继电器/舵机输出电压约为 3.3V，而 CHDK 需要 5V 触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:79
#: 68ea0e85adc6452dac73c38dae82ef15
msgid ""
"A circuit and PCB you can use are shown below. 5V should be supplied from a "
"BEC (or from a BEC powering the central pin on the AUX output rail) because "
"the servo rail itself is not powered."
msgstr "下方显示了可以使用的电路和 PCB。5V 应由 BEC 提供（或从 AUX 输出轨中间引脚上的 BEC 供电），因为舵机轨本身没有供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:83
#: 751deb351b1c4ce1b80623c34ea91932
msgid "1 x BC547 or 2N3904"
msgstr "1 个 BC547 或 2N3904"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:85
#: 7f38541740f14b129e2178b4b7b3127c
msgid "1 x BC557 or 2N3906"
msgstr "1 个 BC557 或 2N3906"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:87
#: f92c533922b4452c9b0c0663295d3dad
msgid "2 x 1 K"
msgstr "2 个 1K 电阻"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:89
#: 07f884655d37422183ead6daa2976522
msgid "1 x 220 ohm"
msgstr "1 个 220 欧姆电阻"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:96
#: 4c2d2d4361854acfa141591f99e118bd
msgid "3Vto 5V Shifter Circuit"
msgstr "3V 转 5V 升压电路"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:101
#: 546fbdadee484ef7b19c700f98ae0d2b
msgid "3V to5V Shifter (PCB)"
msgstr "3V 转 5V 升压器（PCB）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:105
#: b25d1031adc248b380412f1f6021408e
msgid ""
"The voltage stepper circuit and PCB above are `from the community discussion"
" boards <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/using-aux-pins-as-relays-for-"
"chdk?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1581209>`__."
msgstr ""
"上述升压电路和 PCB `来自社区论坛讨论 <https://diydrones.com/forum/topics/using-aux-pins-as-"
"relays-for-chdk?commentId=705844%3AComment%3A1581209>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:107
#: ac53811f22c24f1ba471d5e749c8b12b
msgid ""
"It is also possible to find pre-built stepper circuits like the `SparkFun 5V"
" Step-Up Breakout - NCP1402 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10968>`__ "
