#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:111
#: 3c49dc6a22b54d288bceaac8b30f934c
msgid "Cable for connecting to APM"
msgstr "连接到 APM 的线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:113
#: 0a3af59cc6d4455bbc50621ef25c883f
msgid ""
"A cable is needed to connect the APM board to the camera USB port. This "
"section shows how to modify the USB cable that is supplied with the camera, "
"replacing the standard USB connector with a 3-position header that can "
"connect to the AMP output port."
msgstr ""
"需要一根线缆将 APM 板连接到相机 USB 端口。本节介绍如何改造相机附带的 USB 线缆，将标准 USB 接头替换为可连接到 AMP 输出端口的 3"
" 针排针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:120
#: a1abe8c4ad2e4074a02d681781a9d046
msgid ""
"This example uses the USB Mini-B connector that comes with the SX260 HS "
"camera. The same approach should work equally well using the supplied cable "
"on any CHDK-supported Canon Powershot camera."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用 SX260 HS 相机附带的 USB Mini-B 接头。同样的方法也适用于任何支持 CHDK 的佳能 PowerShot "
"相机所附带的线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:124
#: c87ae46d8a424730812cb41d5976bd49
msgid ""
"The components used to attach the servo connector to the wire are shown "
"below. If you don’t have a crimp tool you can just solder a spare servo wire"
" connector instead."
msgstr "下图显示了将舵机接头连接到线缆的所需组件。如果没有压接工具，可以直接将多余的舵机线接头焊接上去。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:131
#: 4c5c6c364ab145538f183defe6216d32
msgid "APM CHDK Camera Control Cable: Parts needed"
msgstr "APM CHDK 相机控制线缆：所需零件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:133
#: feb3c663d98f46288f5688792771d998
msgid ""
"We’ll only be using the Mini-B side of this cable, so measure whatever "
"length you need from that end depending on how your camera and autopilot "
"mount in your airframe. I’ve measured out about 14″ and cut the cable "
"completely through. Inside are four wires, we only need the red and black "
"wire so cut away the green and white wires. Strip the ends of the red and "
"black wires."
msgstr ""
"我们只需要使用线缆的 Mini-B 一端，因此根据相机和飞控在机架中的安装位置，从该端测量所需长度。我量出约 14 "
"英寸并完全剪断线缆。内部有四根线，我们只需要红色和黑色线，因此剪掉绿色和白色线。剥开红色和黑色线的末端。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:143
#: 91e8db6406884617b966e9f194436ab8
msgid "CHDK Camera Control Cable:Stripped Wires"
msgstr "CHDK 相机控制线缆：剥线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:145
#: abd8836a795e4abda732d0adf1fd3e93
msgid ""
"If you have the crimp tool, crimp and insert the wires into the first and "
"third positions of a 3-position header. If you don’t have the crimp tool, "
"solder these two wires to the ground and signal wires of a spare servo wire."
" Insert the ground wire into the side with an arrow so you can tell which "
"wire is which later on."
msgstr ""
"如果有压接工具，将线压接并插入 3 "
"针排针的第一和第三位置。如果没有压接工具，将这两根线焊接到多余舵机线的地线和信号线上。将地线插入有箭头标记的一侧，以便日后区分两根线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:154
#: b5fcd64fa33a4a4db4a6bb1e2f05b542
msgid "CHDK Camera Cable:Attaching the 3-Position Header"
msgstr "CHDK 相机线缆：安装 3 针排针"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:156
#: e9fd0108b458493da73691b8efd67216
msgid ""
"Cover the connector with heatshrink. Be careful with the hot air near the "
"connector as it can cause the locking plastic pieces in the receptacle to "
"deform."
msgstr "用热缩管覆盖连接器。在连接器附近使用热风时要小心，以免心形卡锁塑料件因受热变形。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:163
#: 440e5240ecbc4de085e747664252fedd
msgid "ACHDK Camera Cable: Connector covered withHeatshrink"
msgstr "ACHDK 相机线缆：热缩管覆盖的连接器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:166
#: fbf0627c8092465186298f8b6f276761
msgid "Camera shutter configuration in Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中的相机快门配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:168
#: d4d25d8d328c4a029f4a0fa0e685222f
msgid ""
":ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` explains how to configure a Pixhawk AUX output or the "
"APM2.x A9 pin as a relay camera trigger. Connect the cable to the "
"appropriate port as described, and to the camera."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner 中的相机快门配置 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` 介绍了如何将 "
"Pixhawk AUX 输出或 APM2.x A9 引脚配置为继电器相机触发器。按照说明将线缆连接到相应端口并连接到相机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:173
#: 8ae68576518d4f5b9002a9ca39cceb8b
msgid ""
"The specific Mission Planner settings required for this CHDK hardware are "
"listed below. Note that duration required may be different on some cameras:"
msgstr "此 CHDK 硬件所需的 Mission Planner 具体设置如下。请注意，某些相机所需的持续时间可能不同："

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:177
#: 8d0f2992b02a4873a749907763776f78
msgid "Pixhawk:"
msgstr "Pixhawk："

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:179
#: 7fb55cb319f84a1ab535769d4d34966f
msgid "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``: 1 (Relay)."
msgstr "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``：1（继电器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:180
#: c7751a045d244b72b164cdcb29850e68
msgid ""
"``Shutter (Port)``: RC10 (Name of connected port, in this example we use "
"RC10 = AUX2)."
msgstr "``Shutter (Port)``：RC10（连接端口的名称，本例中使用 RC10 = AUX2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:183
#: 123629aec44f4074aae76226223e02bc
msgid "APM2.x:"
msgstr "APM2.x："

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:185
#: b0b12c8b13784e57811e4c441aac3f21
msgid "``Shutter (Port)``: Relay (A9 Pin)."
msgstr "``Shutter (Port)``：继电器（A9 引脚）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:187
#: 36ffab5fa12c48ca84ecb37e942b8c92
msgid "``Shutter Duration``: 1 (1/10 second)"
msgstr "``Shutter Duration``：1（1/10 秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:188
#: 4dc0b40b71da47e9b0003386a95af5b2
msgid ""
"``CH7_OPT`` : 9 (Optional - enables manual shutter triggering on Copter "
"only)."
msgstr "``CH7_OPT``：9（可选——仅在 Copter 上启用手动快门触发）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:191
#: 6e909475ca724bc2aa83499b8e5f81fe
msgid ""
"The servo settings are not used for the relay configuration, and can be "
"ignored."
msgstr "舵机设置不用于继电器配置，可以忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:195
#: 566211704c9a4382870e7c3bc4f77dfe
msgid "Creating and installing the CHDK script"
msgstr "创建并安装 CHDK 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:197
#: 7ade067ef2974dfd89375006f1a131da
msgid ""
"One of the simplest scripts you can use is **E38_APM.bas**, which simply "
"waits on the relay signal and then takes a picture (originally from "
"www.event38.com):"
msgstr "您可以使用的最简单脚本之一是 **E38_APM.bas**，它只是等待继电器信号然后拍照（最初来自 www.event38.com）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:223
#: ce5cd91d87154e2da0e571c5940dba07
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can use a more advanced script to set up the camera focus,"
" exposure or other settings before taking the picture. A good starting point"
" is the open source `KAP UAV Exposure Control Script "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/KAP_UAV_Exposure_Control_Script>`__ (v3.1). This"
" was used as the basis for the `3DR Aero Plane "
"<https://3dr.com/kb/aero-m/>`__ *3DR EAI (Exposure-Aperture-ISO)* script "
"described in the `Aero-M Operation Manual <https://3dr.com/kb/aero-m/>`__."
msgstr ""
"或者，您可以使用更高级的脚本在拍照前设置相机对焦、曝光或其他设置。一个很好的起点是开源的 `KAP UAV 曝光控制脚本 "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/KAP_UAV_Exposure_Control_Script>`__（v3.1）。这是 "
"`3DR Aero Plane <https://3dr.com/kb/aero-m/>`__ 的 *3DR EAI（曝光-光圈-ISO）* "
"脚本的基础，详见 `Aero-M 操作手册 <https://3dr.com/kb/aero-m/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:229
#: 93d33148d60c463ab7b4a6ea2cddc8ff
msgid ""
"The `CHDK Wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ explains how you set up "
"CHDK and install and activate scripts for your particular camera. Installing"
" scripts is usually as simple as copying them into the \"scripts\" directory"
" on your SD card. You can then activate them by navigating to the menu "
"**Miscellaneous Stuff \\| Remote Parameters** and making sure the **Enable "
"Remote** setting is checked."
msgstr ""
"`CHDK Wiki <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/CHDK>`__ 介绍了如何为您的特定相机设置 CHDK "
"以及安装和激活脚本。安装脚本通常只需将其复制到 SD 卡的 「scripts」目录中。然后导航到菜单 **杂项 \\| 远程参数** 并确保勾选 "
"**启用远程** 设置来激活它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:239
#: 878f161d7ead4c9e9ce3743e27a9fe09
msgid "CHDK: Camera Menu to EnableRemote"
msgstr "CHDK：启用远程的相机菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:242
#: bc0a1aa81dd04a0bad5143fd1caea419
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:244
#: feea3731fd3d4d63bd6df99f5d574a86
msgid ""
"Load and run your CHDK script. On Copter you should be able to trigger the "
"shutter using the CH7 switch."
msgstr "加载并运行您的 CHDK 脚本。在 Copter 上，您应该可以使用 CH7 开关触发快门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:247
#: 4554312ddec048968de5854cac99d5bc
msgid ""
"On other vehicles set the ``CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` to 1 or 2 meters. Small changes"
" in the GPS readings will cause the distance value to count up slowly and it"
" should trigger the shutter every few seconds. If nothing happens at all, "
"take your vehicle outside and walk around to make sure that some distance is"
" detected. If your camera lens closes and opens instead of taking a picture,"
" make sure the CHDK *remote enable* setting is activated on the camera."
msgstr ""
"在其他飞行器上，将 ``CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` 设置为 1 或 2 米。GPS "
"读数的微小变化将使距离值缓慢累加，并应每隔几秒触发一次快门。如果完全没有反应，请将飞行器带到户外走动，确保检测到一些距离。如果相机镜头只是开合而不是拍照，请确认相机上已激活"
" CHDK 的 *远程启用* 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:258
#: 86bd9e91425b44bfa4647fa5987c6e35
msgid "Using a servo instead of a relay"
msgstr "使用舵机代替继电器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:260
#: 64bc6573b9774a3f95789c35bd92a658
msgid ""
"It is also possible to trigger the camera shutter using a servo output, but "
"that requires additional (and often more expensive) hardware to decode the "
"servo's PWM signal. The :ref:`CHDK Camera Control Tutorial <common-chdk-"
"camera-control-tutorial>` describes a suitable PWM-to-voltage pulse cable, "
"and information from which the servo settings can be inferred."
msgstr ""
"也可以使用舵机输出触发相机快门，但这需要额外的（通常更昂贵的）硬件来解码舵机的 PWM 信号。:ref:`CHDK 相机控制教程 <common-"
"chdk-camera-control-tutorial>` 介绍了合适的 PWM 转电压脉冲线缆，以及可以推断出舵机设置的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:269
#: daeabb045819475da265464468ee2d0d
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CHDK Camera Control Tutorial <common-chdk-camera-control-"
"tutorial>` integrates with the camera as a \"generic servo\" rather than as "
"a shutter trigger. This approach means that camera triggering is not as well"
" integrated with mission planning, but more camera commands can be called."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CHDK 相机控制教程 <common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial>` "
"以「通用舵机」而非快门触发器的方式与相机集成。这种方式意味着相机触发与任务规划的集成不够紧密，但可以调用更多的相机命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:278
#: 9739b7a2cc854a0187fda9bf28e9a3a2
msgid "CHDK Cables for purchase"
msgstr "可购买的 CHDK 线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:280
#: 49a2c9e6b34046339f05b6e0f81ca5dd
msgid ""
"This section is for listing CHDK cables that you can purchase (rather than "
"creating your own, as described in this article). Please extend the list if "
"you discover more."
msgstr "本节用于列出可购买的 CHDK 线缆（而非如本文所述自制）。如果您发现更多，请扩充此列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:285
#: 5f744710a6424471abca9b3754a33496
msgid "Tuffwing camera trigger cable for Pixhawk"
msgstr "Tuffwing Pixhawk 相机触发线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-to-chdk-camera-link-tutorial.rst:287
#: 620082cae7aa4cdea02d5171160cf807
msgid ""
"Tuffwing camera trigger cable for connecting Pixhawk to a CHDK Canon "
"PowerShot. This includes circuitry to upscale the Pixhawk 3.3 volt signal to"
" 5 volts from the + pin. You'll need to have an ESC with an BEC or UBEC "
"plugged into any of the open AUX or MAIN OUTs on the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"用于将 Pixhawk 连接到 CHDK 佳能 PowerShot 的 Tuffwing 相机触发线缆。该线缆内置电路，将 Pixhawk 的 3.3V"
" 信号升压到 5V（来自 + 引脚）。您需要在 Pixhawk 的任意空闲 AUX 或 MAIN OUT 上插接带 BEC 或 UBEC 的 ESC。"

